  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I know VRChat is going to introduce users to world tags one day, but right now we have no idea how it's going to work, so, in the meantime, considering what we've got right now, since no details are gonna be shared, I'd like to request a category for so-called \"game worlds\". \n\nThere are many examples we could see in this category, such as CTF, Murder, Never Have I Ever, Courtroom, as well as multiple Werewolf worlds. Also, it would be nice to have them sorted, for example, by update time or current number of player, or maybe even something completely new and unexpected, such as users rating, which I would like to see in the future as well.\n\nAdditionally, it would be nice to see competitive worlds (CTF, Battle Discs, Miner Dispute) viewed apart from others, but I guess that would be way too specific for now, and we're gonna wait for tags to be added.",
